== Legacy Rewards ==
{{main|Wizard's Vault/Legacy Rewards|label=For Legacy Rewards, see}}
{{icon|misc|Wizard's Vault Legacy Rewards.png‎}} Cosmetic rewards from previous Wizard's Vault seasons can be found in this tab for a slightly increased price (+20%). Previously purchased items cannot be purchased again from the Legacy tab.

