== Notes ==
* For research into possible objective cycles, see [[Wizard's Vault/research]].
* While players without the ''Secrets of the Obscure'' expansion can not visit [[Wizard's Vault (point of interest)|the physical location of the vault]], they can access all of the functions of the vault via the in-game menu regardless.
* If a player does not collect the reward for a daily, weekly or special objective before it resets it will be lost, independent of whether the completed objective is part of the new rotation or not.
* Game updates do '''not''' reset the daily and weekly objectives, even when the Astral Rewards and special objectives are updated. A player who completes the weekly objectives on Monday before an update on a Tuesday will not get a new set of weekly objectives.
* Depending on [[expansion]] ownership, it is possible for a Daily Objective to be included twice. This results in only 3 shown objectives (excluding the log-in) rather than the usual 4, but the duplicated objective will count as two for the daily completion.

== Version history ==
{{section-stub|mechanic|Likely missing changes}}
* Prior to the [[Game updates/2023-11-07|November 07, 2023 game update]], the [[Wizard's Vault Daily Completion Chest|daily completion chest]] granted {{Astral acclaim|30}}.
* The [[Game updates/2026-02-03|February 3, 2026 game update]] updated available objectives and aimed to improve variety. It also changed some recurring rewards and {{item icon|Astral Acclaim}} pricing. Additionally, daily/weekly objective types can now be separately selected, and changed immediately as long as no objective has been completed.

